scn 1
# The arrival layout (2026-11-16; tools/legion_overtake_test.py): three speeds in one right-click, a loose block of
# 4 slow 2x2 bodies (1.10), 3 mid 2x2 ones (1.9), 3 fast 3x3 ones (2.9) and 4 more slow ones, front to rear, sent
# about 1,000 px. Asset-free, open field.
name overtake-click-mix3-1000
ticks 6000
players 1
weapons off
map flat 128 220
type slow mover 2 2500 1 1.10
type mid mover 2 2500 1 1.9
type fast mover 3 2500 1 2.9
group S1 0 slow 4 rect 54 140 70 150 pitch=5
group M1 0 mid 3 rect 54 152 70 160 pitch=5
group F1 0 fast 3 rect 54 162 70 172 pitch=6
group S2 0 slow 4 rect 54 174 70 184 pitch=5
at 5 move S1,M1,F1,S2 62 100
